---
source: crates/ym-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"looks\", \"list\"])"
---
List the built-in and imported looks, with ids, names, groups and inputs; the default look is marked

Usage: ym looks list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json     Print the list as JSON
  -q, --quiet    Print only errors on stderr
  -v, --verbose  Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
  -h, --help     Print help
